{"asset_key":"ep7/gameplay_story_17600090","episode":"ep7","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"17600090","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1760009001:1":{"text":"大和！我终于见到你了……！","source_cn":"大和！我终于见到你了……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB01E8FCC693F30B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1760009002:1":{"text":"抱歉，加布兽，让你久等了。","source_cn":"抱歉，加布兽，让你久等了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3065BB6942A419D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1760009003:0":{"text":"谢谢你为我做了这么多……谢谢你，加布兽。","source_cn":"谢谢你为我做了这么多……谢谢你，加布兽。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A8D9E2AE6845E82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1760009004:0":{"text":"没关系，只要能和大和再次见面，我什么都愿意做。","source_cn":"没关系，只要能和大和再次见面，我什么都愿意做。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4606C67F97106DCD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1760009005:1":{"text":"只是……大和，我违反了很多校规，可能要被关很久禁闭……","source_cn":"只是……大和，我违反了很多校规，可能要被关很久禁闭……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51A0BF547C19671E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1760009006:1":{"text":"放心，这件事就交给我。","source_cn":"放心，这件事就交给我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25491BB85E1B472D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1760009007:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，可以再带我们见一次康缇丝吗？","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCF286BB1148CEC9A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，可以再带我们见一次康缇丝吗？","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，可以再带我们见一次康缇丝吗？","variant_male_record_index":"236839","variant_female_record_index":"236840","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:12:1760009008:1":{"text":"你带着众人绕开了守卫，赶回了图书馆的校规书前……","source_cn":"","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x83987F38E0AAAC15","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"你带着众人绕开了守卫，赶回了图书馆的校规书前……","female":"你带着众人绕开了守卫，赶回了图书馆的校规书前……","variant_male_record_index":"236841","variant_female_record_index":"236842","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1760009009:1":{"text":"嗯……又是你们啊……","source_cn":"嗯……又是你们啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE045C17503E74E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1760009010:0":{"text":"我有一事相求。我想申请，能不能把加布兽的惩罚，换到我身上？","source_cn":"我有一事相求。我想申请，能不能把加布兽的惩罚，换到我身上？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F9FE599929F35D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","do